---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage
  title="Cookie Policy | IdeaRevive Digital Marketing"
  heading="Cookie Policy"
  description="Which cookies the IdeaRevive website may use, what each type of cookie does, and how you can block, delete or control cookies in your browser."
  path="/cookie-policy/"
  summary="The IdeaRevive website may use strictly necessary, analytics and marketing cookies. You can block or delete non-essential cookies in your browser at any time without affecting your use of the site."
>
  <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. This page explains which cookies {site.url} may use and why.</p>
  <h2>Types of cookies we use</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Strictly necessary</td><td>Core site functions such as form spam protection</td><td>Form provider session cookies</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Analytics</td><td>Understanding how visitors use the site so we can improve it</td><td>Google Analytics 4</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Marketing</td><td>Measuring and improving ad campaigns</td><td>Google Ads, Meta Pixel</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>How to manage cookies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use your browser settings to block or delete cookies.</li>
    <li>Use your browser’s private mode to avoid storing cookies after you close it.</li>
    <li>Opt out of personalised Google ads through your Google account ad settings.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Blocking analytics or marketing cookies does not affect your ability to use this website.</p>
  <h2>Changes to this cookie policy</h2>
  <p>If we add new tools that set cookies, we will update this page and the date shown at the top.</p>
  <h2>Questions about cookies</h2>
  <p>Questions about cookies or tracking can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>Why this page exists</h2>
  <p>
    Indian visitors have a right to know what is stored on their device. This cookie policy sits next to our
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> so you can see both the data we collect through forms and the
    data browsers may store automatically. IdeaRevive is a Hyderabad digital marketing agency; we use analytics
    and ads tools in the same way we set them up for clients, and we keep this page honest about that.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are comparing agencies, this is a small trust test: a marketing company that hides its own tracking
    is unlikely to be careful with yours. We would rather list the cookies, explain the purpose, and let you
    switch them off than pretend the site uses none.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
